{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>To discipline you.</b> Therefore He made you hear His voice, so that you would fear Him, as they said: let not Elohim speak with us, lest we die. And behold, you feared because of the eyes and the ears. Furthermore, according to another interpretation: He made you hear His voice because He loved your fathers — they are the three."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:22:19.187422395Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}